{"unit_id":"PangYiMing__dsh-mobile-control#card-zh","repo":"PangYiMing/dsh-mobile-control","commit":"4d9a2bb828166d14ecf19d0246699ccc5d601739","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-control 是一个面向 DSH agent 工具集的 iOS 模拟器控制插件。它注册八个 mobile_* 工具，并通过 WebDriverAgent 与 xcrun simctl 完成设备操作。用户可以检查或启动 WDA、查找界面元素并点击、截取模拟器画面、读取可访问性树、打开 URL 或应用深链，以及预先授予应用隐私权限。适合需要让 DSH 自动操作 iOS 模拟器、检查界面状态或运行应用流程的开发者。运行需要 macOS、iOS 模拟器和完整版 Xcode，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:102-116","index.js:149-307","scripts/wda-up.sh:14-20"]}
{"unit_id":"PangYiMing__dsh-mobile-control#card-en","repo":"PangYiMing/dsh-mobile-control","commit":"4d9a2bb828166d14ecf19d0246699ccc5d601739","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mobile-control adds iOS simulator tools to DSH using WebDriverAgent and xcrun simctl. It can start WDA, find and tap interface elements, capture screenshots, inspect accessibility data, open deep links, and grant simulator privacy permissions. Requires macOS, a simulator, and full Xcode.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:102-116","index.js:149-307","scripts/wda-up.sh:14-20"]}
