{"unit_id":"PangYiMing__dsh-mobile-control#feature-1","repo":"PangYiMing/dsh-mobile-control","commit":"4d9a2bb828166d14ecf19d0246699ccc5d601739","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-control 的功能「模拟器截图」：通过 mobile_screenshot 调用 simctl，将当前模拟器画面保存为 PNG；用户可指定输出路径和目标 UDID，未指定路径时写入带时间戳的 /tmp 文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:149-169"]}
{"unit_id":"PangYiMing__dsh-mobile-control#feature-2","repo":"PangYiMing/dsh-mobile-control","commit":"4d9a2bb828166d14ecf19d0246699ccc5d601739","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-control 的功能「查找并点击元素」：mobile_find_element 按标签、控件类型或 WDA 定位策略查找元素并返回 id；mobile_tap 点击元素或逻辑坐标。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:171-241"]}
{"unit_id":"PangYiMing__dsh-mobile-control#feature-3","repo":"PangYiMing/dsh-mobile-control","commit":"4d9a2bb828166d14ecf19d0246699ccc5d601739","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-control 的功能「启动与检查 WDA」：mobile_status 查询本机 WDA 状态；mobile_wda_up 可启动服务，接受可选模拟器 UDID，并返回就绪状态与日志片段。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:116-147","scripts/wda-up.sh:35-77"]}
{"unit_id":"PangYiMing__dsh-mobile-control#feature-4","repo":"PangYiMing/dsh-mobile-control","commit":"4d9a2bb828166d14ecf19d0246699ccc5d601739","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-control 的功能「可访问性树」：mobile_accessibility_tree 从当前会话取得前台应用的 XML 可访问性树，并按 maxChars 参数截断返回内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:243-262"]}
{"unit_id":"PangYiMing__dsh-mobile-control#feature-5","repo":"PangYiMing/dsh-mobile-control","commit":"4d9a2bb828166d14ecf19d0246699ccc5d601739","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-control 的功能「打开深链和授权」：mobile_open_url 用 simctl 打开 URL 或自定义 scheme；mobile_grant_privacy 为指定应用授予模拟器隐私权限。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:264-307"]}
